                "math_content": "\\begin{array}{r l} & \\xrightarrow {f (t)} \\xrightarrow {h _ {1} (t)} \\xrightarrow {y (t)} \\xrightarrow {h _ {2} (t)} \\xrightarrow {f (t)} \\\\ & \\quad \\text {原系统} \\quad \\text {逆系统} \\\\ & \\quad y (t) = f (t) * h _ {1} (t) \\\\ & \\quad f (t) = y (t) * h _ {2} (t) \\\\ & \\quad f (t) = f (t) * h _ {1} (t) * h _ {2} (t) \\end{array}",
                "math_type": "latex",
